      <p begin="01:22.240" end="01:24.230" ttm:agent="v1">Who else got ’em obsessed like Jennie</p>
      <p begin="01:24.230" end="01:26.600" ttm:agent="v1">Like like like</p>
      <p begin="01:26.600" end="01:28.190" ttm:agent="v1">I think I really like Jennie</p>
